            <ArticleTitle>[Dysphagia in patients undergoing anterior cervical surgery].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>499-502</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Dysphagia is one of the complications of anterior cervical surgery. Although common, few articles were published on this subject. Its incidence and duration varies depending on the author. We show a prospective study, analyzing the incidence, duration and quality of the dysphagia after anterior cervical surgery.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
